{"id":"276530c5ead0bed8","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-well-founded-model.md","title":"Well-founded Model","display":"df-well-founded-model — Well-founded Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-well-founded-model","aliases":["89-df-well-founded-model"],"display":"df-well-founded-model — Well-founded Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model-full]]","[[89-df-well-founded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-well-founded-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-well-founded-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-founded-model — Well-founded Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3b9adbd63f31929\" href=\"?note=d3b9adbd63f31929\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model-full\">89-df-kripke-model-full</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KMod}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KMod}(W,R)\\)</span> is the model class from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3b9adbd63f31929\" href=\"?note=d3b9adbd63f31929\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model-full\">89-df-kripke-model-full</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}_{W}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}_{W}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WFModel}(W,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{KMod}(W,R)\\mid\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WFModel}(W,R)\\coloneqq\n\\{(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{KMod}(W,R)\\mid\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WFModel}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WFModel}(W,R)\\)</span> : 底层框架固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R)\">\\((W,R)\\)</span> 的良基模型集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(R)\\)</span> : 关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>是良基的</li>\n<li>GL在传递且逆良基的框架上完全</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model-full","status":"resolved","id":"d3b9adbd63f31929","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model-full]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9eaa23de86feec90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model-full","status":"resolved","id":"d3b9adbd63f31929","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KMod}(W,R)$ is the model class from [[89-df-kripke-model-full]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9eaa23de86feec90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}_{W}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-well-founded]].","embed":f